0240:                   *** BUG FIX
0240:                   * The following two lines fix a long-standing bug in IOMan where
0240:                   * the I$Detach routine would deallocate the V$STAT area.  This is
0240:                   * because the V$USRS offset on the stack, where the temporary
0240:                   * device table entry was being built, contained 0.  I$Detach wouldn't
0240:                   * bother to do a lookup to see if it should release the memory if
0240:                   * this value was zero, so here force I$Detach to do the lookup no
0240:                   * matter the V$USRS value
0240:                   * BGP 04/30/2002
